        <mxCell id="note" value="Top row is the data flow and its UDP ports. Diagonals are ethernet pin membership — all four nodes join the same L2 segment.&lt;br&gt;Every hop is same-subnet and same-bridge, so no routing, gateway, or broker is needed." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="305" width="860" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
